          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "T-S 8.133 1r + T-S 16.210 1r",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[On] the fifth day (of the week), four days in the m[onth ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">from the destruction of the holy Temple [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">His place, to see His glory in the building of [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">which is on the sea. May the two of them rejoice and [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and willingly, voluntarily and of [my own] choi[ce ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to marry this Sayyida, the virgin [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and honor her in the manner of [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">their wives faithfully [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">of Solomon (whose) s(oul is at) r(est) to [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this Yeshu\u02bfa [... which Moses/the sages]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">(may his/their) mem(ory) be a bles(sing) [instructed] to give [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in Arabic \u02bfAz\u012b[ziyya ...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">incumbent upon him twenty-five [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">before trustworthy elders, and they are [... And with this]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">understanding the two sides consented [... on the]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">court [stipulations], from beginning to end. Strong [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">And we performed a qinyan with Yeshu\u02bfa, [the] groom [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u1e24iss\u016bn b. Eli [...]\u00a0</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>",
